    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>In early September 2021, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure&nbsp;SQL:&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://aka.ms/sqlmi-new-delete-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SQL Managed Instance removes virtual cluster as part of the delete flow for better Infrastructure-as-Code deployments</a>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
